flowchart TB
accTitle: Contact-center routing and conversational fulfillment cooperate
accDescr: Connect receives the call and invokes Lex to understand intent and collect details. The flow either completes an authorized backend action or routes the caller and context to an agent.
C[Customer phone call]:::inputData --> N[Amazon Connect flow]:::process
N --> L[Lex V2<br/>Intent and required slots]:::process
L --> D{Supported self-service task?}:::decision
D -->|Yes, caller authorized| B[Backend fulfillment]:::process
B --> R[Response to caller]:::output
D -->|Agent needed| A[Connect queue and agent<br/>Transfer context]:::output
